' 11/10/2026: nm.origin's status read (gosub5) as soon as it's opened, and the
' file used only if it opened: without the file, the drive kept 62 (file not
' found) on channel 15 (the E-Mail drive), the next gosub5 put it in e%, and
' i.SB 3470 / 4014 here then returned before printing a post's text (every
' entry here runs 4178 with NetMail on: reading too); z1$ (the origin line
' added to NetSub posts) was junk. e% is cleared on the way out. Found on
